// Vortex Portal for the 1.28″ round GC9A01 colour display (240x240)
// Generated by Vortex Portal Studio for: ESP32-S3 (DevKitC, Mini, SuperMini)
// Works on ESP32 (all types), Raspberry Pi Pico (RP2040/RP2350) and Teensy 4.
// To use another board, change the pin numbers in the "Board" section below.
// Libraries (Library Manager): "Adafruit GC9A01A" and "Adafruit GFX Library".
// The portal is drawn in the centre of the screen.
//
// Wiring:  VCC->3V3  GND->GND  SCL->GPIO 12  SDA->GPIO 11  DC->GPIO 9  CS->GPIO 10  RST->GPIO 13  BLK->3V3 (if present)
//
// Live tuning: plug in over USB, open Vortex Portal Studio in Chrome or Edge and click
// "Connect over USB". The board saves the settings.

#if defined(__AVR__) || defined(ESP8266)
  #error "This screen needs a board with more memory: an ESP32, Raspberry Pi Pico or Teensy 4."
#endif

